    <content>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"c3f20002-1001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"c3f20002-2001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Setup domain, project and initial data"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Setup"},{"alias":"content","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"c3f20002-3001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003ESetup Domain\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIn addition to the configurations used for Umbraco, we also provide other configurations for backoffice and language customization.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIf you want to use multi site or configure separate backoffice, please update the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosts file\u003C/strong\u003E according to each operating system:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFor Windows: C:\\Windows\\System32\\Drivers\\etc\\hosts\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFor MacOS and Linux: /etc/hosts\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-appsettings-config.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Setup appsettings config\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-hosts-file.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Setup hosts file\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003ESetup Project\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESetting up uTPro is simple. Once you have downloaded the source code, you can open the project solution file in Visual Studio. We recommend using Visual Studio 2022 (or later).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-visual-studio-solution.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Setup Visual Studio solution\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThen follow the minimum requirements of the Umbraco CMS project:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDatabase\u003C/strong\u003E: uTPro ships configured for PostgreSQL (default), and also supports SQL Server and SQLite. Change the ConnectionString in appsettings.json with key \u003Cstrong\u003EumbracoDbDSN\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETarget framework\u003C/strong\u003E: .NET 10 (Changes depending on the Umbraco version in use \u2014 Umbraco 17 runs on .NET 10)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-database-config.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Setup database config\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-connection-string.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Setup connection string\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-target-framework.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Setup target framework\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003ESetup Data\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe project has been integrated with data, and you can use \u003Cstrong\u003EuSync to synchronize data\u003C/strong\u003E after installing Umbraco CMS.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-usync-import.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Setup uSync import\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIn the \u0022Everything\u0022 group, select \u0022Import\u0022 and wait for the results, then refresh the page, return to the \u0022Content\u0022 tab to check the results.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-usync-result.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Setup uSync result\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"c3f20002-3001-4000-b002-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"c3f20002-3001-4000-b002-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"c3f20002-4001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"c3f20002-5001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"c3f20002-1001-4000-b002-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null},{"contentKey":"c3f20002-2001-4000-b002-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"c3f20002-2001-4000-b002-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"c3f20002-5001-4000-b002-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}],"key":"74341b8e-afe1-47c5-bd24-d94b157e8a1c"}],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"c3f20002-1001-4000-b002-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"c3f20002-4001-4000-b002-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}]}}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="vi-VN"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"d1f10002-1001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"d1f10002-2001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"C\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t domain, project v\u00E0 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u ban \u0111\u1EA7u"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"H\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn C\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t"},{"alias":"content","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"d1f10002-3001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003EC\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t Domain\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENgo\u00E0i c\u00E1c c\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh d\u00E0nh cho Umbraco, ch\u00FAng t\u00F4i cung c\u1EA5p th\u00EAm c\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh cho backoffice v\u00E0 t\u00F9y ch\u1EC9nh ng\u00F4n ng\u1EEF.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EN\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n mu\u1ED1n s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng multi site ho\u1EB7c c\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh backoffice ri\u00EAng, h\u00E3y c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosts file\u003C/strong\u003E theo h\u1EC7 \u0111i\u1EC1u h\u00E0nh:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWindows: C:\\Windows\\System32\\Drivers\\etc\\hosts\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMacOS v\u00E0 Linux: /etc/hosts\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-appsettings-config.png\u0022 alt=\u0022C\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh appsettings\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-hosts-file.png\u0022 alt=\u0022C\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh hosts file\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EC\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t Project\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EC\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t uTPro r\u1EA5t \u0111\u01A1n gi\u1EA3n. Sau khi t\u1EA3i m\u00E3 ngu\u1ED3n, m\u1EDF file solution trong Visual Studio 2022 (ho\u1EB7c m\u1EDBi h\u01A1n).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-visual-studio-solution.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Visual Studio solution\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESau \u0111\u00F3 \u0111\u00E1p \u1EE9ng y\u00EAu c\u1EA7u t\u1ED1i thi\u1EC3u c\u1EE7a Umbraco CMS:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDatabase\u003C/strong\u003E: uTPro m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh d\u00F9ng PostgreSQL, h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 th\u00EAm SQL Server v\u00E0 SQLite. Thay \u0111\u1ED5i ConnectionString trong appsettings.json v\u1EDBi key \u003Cstrong\u003EumbracoDbDSN\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETarget framework\u003C/strong\u003E: .NET 10 (Umbraco 17 ch\u1EA1y tr\u00EAn .NET 10)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-database-config.png\u0022 alt=\u0022C\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh database\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-connection-string.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Connection string\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-target-framework.png\u0022 alt=\u0022Target framework\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EC\u00E0i \u0111\u1EB7t D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ED\u1EF1 \u00E1n \u0111\u00E3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u00EDch h\u1EE3p s\u1EB5n d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u, b\u1EA1n c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 d\u00F9ng \u003Cstrong\u003EuSync \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u\u003C/strong\u003E sau khi c\u00E0i Umbraco CMS.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-usync-import.png\u0022 alt=\u0022uSync import\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETrong nh\u00F3m \u0022Everything\u0022, ch\u1ECDn \u0022Import\u0022 v\u00E0 \u0111\u1EE3i k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3, sau \u0111\u00F3 refresh trang, quay l\u1EA1i tab \u0022Content\u0022 \u0111\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m tra.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://raw.githubusercontent.com/T4VN/uTPro/refs/heads/gh-pages/docs/screenshots/setup-usync-result.png\u0022 alt=\u0022K\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 uSync\u0022 /\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f10002-3001-4000-b002-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"d1f10002-3001-4000-b002-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f10002-4001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f10002-5001-4000-b002-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f10002-1001-4000-b002-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null},{"contentKey":"d1f10002-2001-4000-b002-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,